With FastAPI and Pydantic v2, what does the client receive?

```python
class UserOut(BaseModel):
    id: int
    email: str

class UserRecord(UserOut):
    password_hash: str

@app.get("/users/1")
async def get_user() -> UserOut:
    return UserRecord(id=1, email="a@b.io", password_hash="x1y2")
```
